COMPILATION OF: E46M23

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46M23

   1 a 0000 E46M23:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-42/P2b] THE SECOND-ITEM GUARD: an EXPRESSION in position 2.
   4 a 0006      E46L9 pins `list(k + 1)' as a my-gap in position 1; here a
   5 a 0006      character item precedes it, which is the shape a program would
   6 a 0006      actually write. */
   7 c 0006   dcl outf file, v char(20) varying, k fixed bin(15);
   8 c 0006   open file(outf) stream output title('M23OUT DAT');
   9 c 0023   put file(outf) list(v,k + 1);
  10 c 0047   close file(outf);
  11 a 004D end E46M23;

CODE SIZE = 0050
DATA AREA = 0021
FREE SYMS = 388F
END  COMPILATION
